        "stage": "visual",
        "critical": true,
        "description": "Inspect every exact final512px view; volumetric morphology, coherent attachment and no exposed surface interference. Viewed original concept: woody upper branching crown and individual broad hanging leaves clear. Reject overprominent central leaf keel and overly tapered willow shapes; use parallel sides over central leaf length, equal subtle longitudinal vein bands, no dominant midrib. Preserve bare lower trunk and non-mangrove base.",
